rs/AmedeoPelliccia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmePellicciaClouds/Robbbo-T-1/commits/d89e3569d279756d0929ad93cb3623dfd15e3c4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-04T19:03:45Z","email":"amedeo.pelliccia@gmail.com","name":"Amedeo Pelliccia''s"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-04T19:03:45Z","email":"amedeo.pelliccia@gmail.com","name":"Amedeo Pelliccia''s"},"message":"Add GAIA Documentation Ecosystem\n\nAdd steps to create directories and files for the GAIA Documentation Ecosystem in the GitHub workflow.\n\n* **Create directories for GAIA AIR documentation:**\n  - Add steps to create `docs/air` directory with subdirectories for each ATA chapter.\n* **Create directories for GAIA SPACE documentation:**\n  - Add steps to create `docs/space` directory with subdirectories for each SNS chapter.\n* **Create directories for common parts:**\n  - Add steps to create `docs/common` directory with subdirectories for each common part.\n* **Create directories for GP-AM and GP-AS:**\n  - Add steps to create `docs/GP-AM` directory with subdirectories for each ATA chapter.\n  - Add steps to create `docs/GP-AS` directory with subdirectories for each SNS chapter.\n\n---\n\nFor more details, open the [Copilot Workspace session](https://copilot-workspace.githubnext.com/Robbbo-T/Robbbo-T?shareId=XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX).","tree":{"sha":"ab45425b37f9fe812f7a23ae1012f68e56365682","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmePellicciaClouds/Robbbo-T-1/git/trees/ab45425b37f9fe812f7a23ae1012f68e56365682"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AmePellicciaClouds/Robbbo-T-1/git/commits/d89e3569d279756d0929ad93cb3623dfd15e3c4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164860269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPell