b.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/cbee27ceb4ba7a05c31d52cc18e5417811cb42dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:13:46Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T21:13:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deploy): wait for Authentik readiness before billing registration (#1395)\n\nProduction sync at 4e2beff failed because the billing PreSync init\ncontainer immediately hit ECONNREFUSED on the internal Authentik\nservice, despite a ready endpoint and an ingress policy permitting\nsame-namespace traffic. Wait up to 120 seconds on the unauthenticated\nreadiness endpoint before the existing single privileged registration\ncall. Registration and credential validation still fail closed; no\npermissions or credentials change.\n\nValidation: two real HTTP subprocess tests cover 503-to-200 recovery\nwith no Authorization header and bounded permanent failure before\nregistration. Uploaded Git blob hashes match local files. Built\nproduction image tags remain 9cbc8ad28334.","tree":{"sha":"87fddfb0f73d9886b7648ff89ed7fdb907a6a2c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/87fddfb0f73d9886b7648ff89ed7fdb907a6a2c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/cbee27ceb4ba7a05c31d52cc18e5417811cb42dc","verification":{"payload":"tree 87fddfb0f73d9886b7648ff89ed7fdb907a6a2c3\nparent 4e2beff60e7c76a69b25ece62f7905af9d5092de\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791407626 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791407626 +0300\n\nfix(deploy): wait for Authentik readiness before billing registration (#1395)\n\nProduction sync at 4e2beff failed because the billing PreSync init\ncontainer immediately hit ECONNREFUSED on the internal Authentik\nservice, despite a ready endpoint and an ingress policy permitting\nsame-namespace traffic. Wait up to 120 seconds on the unauthenticated\nreadiness endpoint before the existing single privileged registration\ncall. Registration and credential validation still fail closed; no\npermissions or credentials change.\n\nValidation: two real HTTP subprocess tests cover 503-to-200 recovery\nwith no Authorization header and bounded permanent failure before\nregistration. Uploaded Git blob hashes match local files. Built\nproduction image tags remain 9cbc8ad28334.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxrYKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHVAQAH5D1eec+3Irlg+Rz0UMfb7l\nTOJItEsNwRN+fsH26ipIDj7EsLxWP6PlFnQQj4jHheJChxY7KwYLW30Z6SHoNY7y\nksY0Q8Q3THwigTeuBd5H6zfrMr1ggw6KYnkfHM6SvPxNwg8tNiPonOoEcDUO3ZSb\n4QznFLUnG6RYTBT27N+a2X6mPJrWrqOjsxBKnKuw4fo5VJNrJKJ3Iv863RsLu7nk\n9TtOj1gx9feFO6XyK9fXxt7YkSzNRf8Eij20pliLu4yis1xFzpFI3uTDMoIz103d\npmr8DKwA5ZsDmuo8bQJO1QkL2dlTHkPFE1qjMthT4jozb9318o+qw1XLXp+22IO7\nRUJMEGEB1CbFXCPaH/l+xa9znZ4+U4KWCi4qaW7KAypEBET3HiXhi9GbZqV/duLu\nS5H2R+5ofGYZNHFyV78S1QU2j5l1Hay73r47PAIs1p5BNEbxOjcu9ZZ5CrTzM9eO\navTa0UeCP1A172D+o9RKGE5cZqRjTwLF6ygp0xx0i0BGPvLvF3f5ucjtZEgNEqR2\nhenIrsvZVxE7MiJunQ5WgrlBMpxUcNUe7KYwv3hjK4pTA9v5t1J9va/AK/ul1yvT\nkaaI3zvHzstI4E3MohzNCJMZrRkI1ZC8Yq4RMczNGalmduKAJ5WvMvVGAIP0XtaJ\nF7sgDn+FY6//LWqjTtFL\n=9g2E\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T21:13:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":