l":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/434e927bd044519795193e7a645302cf177423fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:14:05Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:14:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ops: wire the standard cluster-query consumer workflow (#1262)\n\nChecking developers.fuzefront.com required ad-hoc cluster reads with\nno self-service path. FuzeInfra already publishes cluster-query as the\ndocumented read-only kubectl channel for consuming repos\n(docs/consuming-repos/CLUSTER_QUERY.md) — FuzeFront never installed\nits consumer side. Add it verbatim from FuzeInfra''s published\ntemplate, reusing the FUZEINFRA_DISPATCH_TOKEN secret this repo\nalready holds for infra-dispatch.yml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01T3JJ4JEuUPCbuRUHtaepgQ\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d298b9ceedefbc5482a93f4ae9d9966fdb6d14a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/d298b9ceedefbc5482a93f4ae9d9966fdb6d14a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/re