ents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/ed9e7ce5da81c458f3d7004dcc22dfa62f2c1f44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:26:00Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:26:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(post-prod): assert root-org membership repair (#750/#1095) on live prod (#1291)\n\n## 📋 Description\n\nBuilds the #1095 post-deploy verification into the post-prod Playwright\ne2e, so a deploy that re-introduces the #750 root-absence symptom (root\nshows GUEST / \"Your organizations\" 500s) **fails loudly** instead of\nbeing caught in a screenshot.\n\nNew spec `frontend/e2e/post-prod/root-membership-smoke.spec.ts` runs in\nthe existing post-prod job (`prod-post-deploy.yml` →\n`playwright.post-prod.config.ts` testDir, no new workflow), READ-ONLY\nagainst the live platform. Two checks, account-agnostic via the\nself-provisioning synthetic (the invariant #1095 established is \"every\nuser is a member of root\"):\n\n1. **API** — `GET /api/organizations` returns **200** (the #750 HTTP-500\nroot-absence crash is gone) and the root org (`…010`) is present with a\n**real role — never `guest`/null** (the universal membership backfill\nmakes every user ≥ `member`).\n2. **UI** — the live `/organizations` screen mounts, its own `GET\n/api/organizations` is 200, and there''s no runtime crash. Selector-free\nso it''s robust to the personal-context flag (`MyOrganizationsPage` vs\n`OrganizationPage`).\n\nSkips loudly when `POST_PROD_PASSWORD` is unset (same contract as\nlive-smoke test 7 — missing coverage, never a guessable fallback). Does\n**not** assert *who* owns root (a specific person); that remains in\n`docs/runbooks/verify-1095-root-owner-backfill.md`.\n\n## 🔄 Type of Change\n- [x] 🧪 Test addition (post-prod e2e)\n\n## 🧪 Testing\n- [x] `playwright test --config playwright.post-prod.config.ts --list`\ndiscovers 