,"node_id":"C_kwDOOzNzMNoAKGM2Mjk5NzNhYzRhZTM3ZDk1ZDUyNjE0OGM3OWFkNTQ1ODBhMGIyYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commit/86ccadee14578475032d67fcf42b8faaa43b3bda","sha":"86ccadee14578475032d67fcf42b8faaa43b3bda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/86ccadee14578475032d67fcf42b8faaa43b3bda"}],"sha":"c629973ac4ae37d95d526148c79ad54580a0b2c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/c629973ac4ae37d95d526148c79ad54580a0b2c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99821070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/86ccadee14578475032d67fcf42b8faaa43b3bda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:43:19Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:43:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"design(app-builder): approval frames — build with FuzeAgent, creator ownership, marketplace publishing (#1285)\n\n## Summary\n\n**Frames only, no code.** `product-designer` frames at\n`design/frames/app-builder/` for\n`docs/planning/app-builder-and-ownership.md` (rollout item F-2), built\nagainst the contract merged in #1261\n(`services/app-registry-service/openapi.yaml`, app-registry 1.2.0).\nEntry point: `design/frames/app-builder/index.html`.\n\n**All four flows are `approved: false`. Please approve or reject each\nflow separately.**\n\n| Flow | Frames | Flag | Orchestrator | `implementation.paths` |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `build-entry` | (a) | `fuzefront.apps.build-with-agent` |\n`BuildEntryFlow` | `packages/app-builder-ui/src/entry/**`,\n`frontend/src/pages/ApplicationsPage.tsx` |\n| `build-session` | (b) (c) (d) | `fuzefront.apps.build-with-agent` |\n`BuildSessionFlow` | `packages/app-builder-ui/src/session/**` |\n| `creator-ownership` | (e) | `fuzefront.apps.creator-ownership` |\n`AppOwnershipCard` | `packages/app-builder-ui/src/ownership/**` |\n| `marketplace-publish` | (f) (g) |\n`fuzefront.apps.marketplace-publishing` | `MarketplacePublishFlow` |\n`packages/app-builder-ui/src/publishing/**` |\n\n**States the frames cover:**\n- **Build entry:** flag ON, flag OFF (the card is not rendered at all),\nflag still loading (treated as OFF), and a shortcut to resume a build\nthat''s already running.\n- **Build session:** form validation and submitting; the launching,\nbuilding and deploying steps; cancel and its confirm dialog; deployed\n(the new app tile appears); failed; cancelled. Error responses: **502**\nlaunch failed, **503** `builder_unavailable` and `feature_disabled`,\n**403** not a member, **409** `no_personal_org`, **429**, **404**, plus\na failed status poll.\n- **Creator ownership:** the creator is still a member (name and\ncontact); a former member (no name, no contact); a personal app; no\ncreator recorded; flag OFF.\n- **Marketplace publish:** none, pending, approved, rejected with the\nreason shown; **409** `ALREADY_PENDING` / `ALREADY_PUBLISHED`; read-only\n(no panel); **403**. The admin queue: approve, reject with a required\nreason, **409** `NOT_PENDING`, empty, loading, error, **403**.\n\n## Overlap with `app-management` on `ApplicationsPage.tsx`\n\n`app-management` already claims `ApplicationsPage.tsx`, and none of its\nflows are approved. `build-entry` claims the same file.\n`gate-frames-first` passes a file once any one flow that claims it is\napproved, so approving `build-entry` lets the card mount land without\nwaiting on app-management. The page edit should stay small: one import\nand one `<BuildAppCard />` after the Add card. The card itself lives in\nthe package. Any other edit to that page still needs app-management''s\napproval.\n\nFlows 3 and 4 render inside app detail, which belongs to\n`app-management/app-detail`. They ship as self-contained components in\nthis package, so they don''t block that flow and aren''t blocked by it. I\nchecked locally: `ApplicationsPage.tsx` lists `app-builder/build-entry`\nand all three app-management flows as its claimants.\n\n## Contract changes these frames need (for `contract-designer`)\n1. **`AppCreator.contactEmail`.** In 1.2.0 the creator has a name but no\ncontact field. Until the field exists, the UI shows the name and leaves\nout the Contact row.\n2. **`GET /publication-requests?status=pending`.** In 1.2.0 an admin can\napprove or reject a single app, but nothing lists the pending requests.\nThe review queue (frame g) can''t be built until this endpoint exists.\n\n## New design-system pieces (foundation PR, `frontend-engineer`)\n`Stepper`, `RadioCardGroup`, `TextareaWithCounter`. This flow also\nreuses `StatusPill`, `Dialog` and `DataTable`, which app-management\nalready requested.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `node scripts/stamp-frames.mjs --check`: all 24 stamps up to date\n(app-builder `5e7510ac…`)\n- [x] `node scripts/check-frames-first.mjs --base origin/master`: OK (no\nfeature UI changed)\n- [x] `GATE_BASE_REF=origin/master python scripts/gate_ds_conformance.py\n. --changed-only`: OK\n- [x] Every manifest `testHooks` selector appears in its frame''s HTML,\nand every frame ↔ flow reference resolves\n- [x] Tokens only: `tokens.css` copied byte-for-byte from `_template`;\n`frame.css` and the frames use no raw hex, rgb or font values\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot[bot] <fuzeone-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d812f79ed2f952b6cd90f219f2634f28ee1ff00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/8d812f79ed2f952b6cd90f219f2634f28ee1ff00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/86ccadee14578475032d67fcf42b8faaa43b3bda","verification":{"payload":"tree 8d812f79ed2f952b6cd90f219f2634f28ee1ff00\nparent 68e41da4c6f89d3a877609e2b1479f3fd1bff1a4\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791186199 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791186199 +0300\n\ndesign(app-builder): approval frames — build with FuzeAgent, creator ownership, marketplace publishing (#1285)\n\n## Summary\n\n**Frames only, no code.** `product-designer` frames at\n`design/frames/app-builder/` for\n`docs/planning/app-builder-and-ownership.md` (rollout item F-2), built\nagainst the contract merged in #1261\n(`services/app-registry-service/openapi.yaml`, app-registry 1.2.0).\nEntry point: `design/frames/app-builder/index.html`.\n\n**All four flows are `approved: false`. Please approve or reject each\nflow separately.**\n\n| Flow | Frames | Flag | Orchestrator | `implementation.paths` |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `build-entry` | (a) | `fuzefront.apps.build-with-agent` |\n`BuildEntryFlow` | `packages/app-builder-ui/src/entry/**`,\n`frontend/src/pages/ApplicationsPage.tsx` |\n| `build-session` | (b) (c) (d) | `fuzefront.apps.build-with-agent` |\n`BuildSessionFlow` | `packages/app-builder-ui/src/session/**` |\n| `creator-ownership` | (e) | `fuzefront.apps.creator-ownership` |\n`AppOwnershipCard` | `packages/app-builder-ui/src/ownership/**` |\n| `marketplace-publish` | (f) (g) |\n`fuzefront.apps.marketplace-publishing` | `MarketplacePublishFlow` |\n`packages/app-builder-ui/src/publishing/**` |\n\n**States the frames cover:**\n- **Build entry:** flag ON, flag OFF (the card is not rendered at all),\nflag still loading (treated as OFF), and a shortcut to resume a build\nthat''s already running.\n- **Build session:** form validation and submitting; the launching,\nbuilding and deploying steps; cancel and its confirm dialog; deployed\n(the new app tile appears); failed; cancelled. Error responses: **502**\nlaunch failed, **503** `builder_unavailable` and `feature_disabled`,\n**403** not a member, **409** `no_personal_org`, **429**, **404**, plus\na failed status poll.\n- **Creator ownership:** the creator is still a member (name and\ncontact); a former member (no name, no contact); a personal app; no\ncreator recorded; flag OFF.\n- **Marketplace publish:** none, pending, approved, rejected with the\nreason shown; **409** `ALREADY_PENDING` / `ALREADY_PUBLISHED`; read-only\n(no panel); **403**. The admin queue: approve, reject with a required\nreason, **409** `NOT_PENDING`, empty, loading, error, **403**.\n\n## Overlap with `app-management` on `ApplicationsPage.tsx`\n\n`app-management` already claims `ApplicationsPage.tsx`, and none of its\nflows are approved. `build-entry` claims the same file.\n`gate-frames-first` passes a file once any one flow that claims it is\napproved, so approving `build-entry` lets the card mount land without\nwaiting on app-management. The page edit should stay small: one import\nand one `<BuildAppCard />` after the Add card. The card itself lives in\nthe package. Any other edit to that page still needs app-management''s\napproval.\n\nFlows 3 and 4 render inside app detail, which belongs to\n`app-management/app-detail`. They ship as self-contained components in\nthis package, so they don''t block that flow and aren''t blocked by it. I\nchecked locally: `ApplicationsPage.tsx` lists `app-builder/build-entry`\nand all three app-management flows as its claimants.\n\n## Contract changes these frames need (for `contract-designer`)\n1. **`AppCreator.contactEmail`.** In 1.2.0 the creator has a name but no\ncontact field. Until the field exists, the UI shows the name and leaves\nout the Contact row.\n2. **`GET /publication-requests?status=pending`.** In 1.2.0 an admin can\napprove or reject a single app, but nothing lists the pending requests.\nThe review queue (frame g) can''t be built until this endpoint exists.\n\n## New design-system pieces (foundation PR, `frontend-engineer`)\n`Stepper`, `RadioCardGroup`, `TextareaWithCounter`. This flow also\nreuses `StatusPill`, `Dialog` and `DataTable`, which app-management\nalready requested.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `node scripts/stamp-frames.mjs --check`: all 24 stamps up to date\n(app-builder `5e7510ac…`)\n- [x] `node scripts/check-frames-first.mjs --base origin/master`: OK (no\nfeature UI changed)\n- [x] `GATE_BASE_REF=origin/master python scripts/gate_ds_conformance.py\n. --changed-only`: OK\n- [x] Every manifest `testHooks` selector appears in its frame''s HTML,\nand every frame ↔ flow reference resolves\n- [x] Tokens only: `tokens.css` copied byte-for-byte from `_template`;\n`frame.css` and the frames use no raw hex, rgb or font values\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot[bot] <fuzeone-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw1UXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVlwQAAS6vjO7zB2w84uFz0aCHmjn\n97q25BsNT2dY+XMg2OMBiFL7UxLqaliJ2GQlL/0ovk8eVJSSeOSybmmSAYc2jK5o\n6E2lCjmn9HayqG317e47Wt4F4eEOAyxmJ88EgFx2m/Sudl27drf9F0p4hJp