.github.com/users/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/cb3b372f527a502844e6a7f452a161deca038023/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:05:43Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:05:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(billing): add event schemas, user.deleted handler, defensive plan fallback (#1279)\n\n## Summary\n\n- **New Zod schemas** `billingTrialEndingSchemaV1` +\n`billingPaymentFailedSchemaV1` added to `@fuzefront/shared/kafka` — both\nevents now use typed `producer.send()` instead of the unvalidated\n`producer.raw.send()` path.\n- **`identity.user.deleted` billing consumer**\n(`billing-service-group-user-deleted`): cancels any user-scoped Stripe\nsubscription on user deletion, mirroring `org-deleted.handler.ts`.\n`cascade:''soft''` → period-end cancel; `cascade:''hard''` → immediate\ncancel. Org-scoped subscriptions are not touched.\n- **Defensive `getActivePlans()` fallback**: catches DB errors and\nreturns `STATIC_DEFAULT_PLANS` so the billing portal shows plans even\nbefore the `billing` schema is bootstrapped or when the DB is\ntemporarily unreachable. Fixes blank Plans tab in the portal.\n- **`docs/runbooks/billing-event-model.md`**: documents every consumed\nand published Kafka topic, payload schemas, consumer group isolation\nrationale, and portal troubleshooting steps.\n\n## What was broken\n\n| Symptom | Root cause | Fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| Plans tab blank | `getActivePlans()` propagated DB errors instead of\nfalling back to static defaults | `try/catch` with\n`STATIC_DEFAULT_PLANS` fallback |\n| `billing.trial.ending` / `billing.payment.failed` bypassed schema\nvalidation | Used `producer.raw.send()` | Created shared Zod schemas;\nswitched to `producer.send()` |\n| `identity.user.deleted` had no billing cleanup | Only ref-index\nprojection was cleaned up; no subscription cancel | New\n`user-deleted.handler.ts` + consumer wired in `index.ts` |\n\n## Events now handled (consumed)\n\n| Topic | Group | Action |\n|---|---|---|\n| `identity.org.created` | `billing-service-group-ref-index` | Ref-index\nprojection only (lazy customer creation on first checkout) |\n| `identity.org.deleted` | `billing-service-group-org-deleted` | Cancel\norg Stripe subscription |\n| `identity.user.deleted` | `billing-service-group-user-deleted` |\nCancel user-scoped Stripe subscription (**new**) |\n| `identity.user.created/updated`, `identity.org.updated`,\n`identity.membership.*` | `billing-service-group-ref-index` | Maintain\n`billing.ref_index` projection |\n| `billing.usage.recorded` | `billing-service-group` | Forward metered\nusage to Stripe |\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] `GET /api/v1/billing/plans` returns 4 static default plans even\nwith no rows in `billing.plans`\n- [ ] Sending `identity.user.deleted` with a user that has a user-scoped\nsubscription cancels it (soft/hard per cascade field)\n- [ ] Sending `identity.user.deleted` for a user with no billing\ncustomer is a no-op (no error)\n- [ ] `billing.trial.ending` and `billing.payment.failed` Kafka messages\npass Zod validation\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01PzTiipQzh8avhw9qoH7cmT\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_01PzTiipQzh8avhw9qoH7cmT)_\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4126b9e2e6da4992cad194b233a4384f6100ad6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/c4126b9e2e6da4992cad194b233a4384f6100ad6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/cb3b372f527a502844e6a7f452a161deca038023","verification":{"payload":"tree c4126b9e2e6da4992cad194b233a4384f6100ad6\nparent 2f6066b7c5791cd84d5af63fb30f15af4c2cd005\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791162343 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791162343 +0300\n\nfeat(billing): add event schemas, user.deleted handler, defensive plan fallback (#1279)\n\n## Summary\n\n- **New Zod schemas** `billingTrialEndingSchemaV1` +\n`billingPaymentFailedSchemaV1` added to `@fuzefront/shared/kafka` — both\nevents now use typed `producer.send()` instead of the unvalidated\n`producer.raw.send()` path.\n- **`identity.user.deleted` billing consumer**\n(`billing-service-group-user-deleted`): cancels any user-scoped Stripe\nsubscription on user deletion, mirroring `org-deleted.handler.ts`.\n`cascade:''soft''` → period-end cancel; `cascade:''hard''` → immediate\ncancel. Org-scoped subscriptions are not touched.\n- **Defensive `getActivePlans()` fallback**: catches DB errors and\nreturns `STATIC_DEFAULT_PLANS` so the billing portal shows plans even\nbefore the `billing` schema is bootstrapped or when the DB is\ntemporarily unreachable. Fixes blank Plans tab in the portal.\n- **`docs/runbooks/billing-event-model.md`**: documents every consumed\nand published Kafka topic, payload schemas, consumer group isolation\nrationale, and portal troubleshooting steps.\n\n## What was broken\n\n| Symptom | Root cause | Fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| Plans tab blank | `getActivePlans()` propagated DB errors instead of\nfalling back to static defaults | `try/catch` with\n`STATIC_DEFAULT_PLANS` fallback |\n| `billing.trial.ending` / `billing.payment.failed` bypassed schema\nvalidation | Used `producer.raw.send()` | Created shared Zod schemas;\nswitched to `producer.send()` |\n| `identity.user.deleted` had no billing cleanup | Only ref-index\nprojection was cleaned up; no subscription cancel | New\n`user-deleted.handler.ts` + consumer wired in `index.ts` |\n\n## Events now handled (consumed)\n\n| Topic | Group | Action |\n|---|---|---|\n| `identity.org.created` | `billing-service-group-ref-index` | Ref-index\nprojection only (lazy customer creation on first checkout) |\n| `identity.org.deleted` | `billing-service-group-org-deleted` | Cancel\norg Stripe subscription |\n| `identity.user.deleted` | `billing-service-group-user-deleted` |\nCancel user-scoped Stripe subscription (**new**) |\n| `identity.user.created/updated`, `identity.org.updated`,\n`identity.membership.*` | `billing-service-group-ref-index` | Maintain\n`billing.ref_index` projection |\n| `billing.usage.recorded` | `billing-service-group` | Forward metered\nusage to Stripe |\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] `GET /api/v1/billing/plans` returns 4 static default plans even\nwith no rows in `billing.plans`\n- [ ] Sending `identity.user.deleted` with a user that has a user-scoped\nsubscription cancels it (soft/hard per cascade field)\n- [ ] Sending `identity.user.deleted` for a user with no billing\ncustomer is a no-op (no error)\n- [ ] `billing.trial.ending` and `billing.payment.failed` Kafka messages\npass Zod validation\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01PzTiipQzh8avhw9qoH7cmT\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_01PzTiipQzh8avhw9qoH7cmT)_\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason"