k upgrade rollout) (SL7) (#1280)\n\nPeriodic, bounded, multi-instance-safe reconciler that backfills platform default lists for orgs created while seeding was OFF and rolls out pack version upgrades. Off by default (SEED_RECONCILER_ENABLED); the master and seed-defaults flags are still checked per org. 24 new real-Postgres tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1","tree":{"sha":"6ca9fe055514a90784dce076efc5d5194c8050e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/6ca9fe055514a90784dce076efc5d5194c8050e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/c8c058d861ede3e4297057bc365d1ce58b97ae81","verification":{"payload":"tree 6ca9fe055514a90784dce076efc5d5194c8050e2\nparent 7a837059c2b87950f89501fa21b9b09daa6db514\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791150216 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791150216 +0300\n\nfeat(selection-list-service): seed reconciler (backfill + pack upgrade rollout) (SL7) (#1280)\n\nPeriodic, bounded, multi-instance-safe reconciler that backfills platform default lists for orgs created while seeding was OFF and rolls out pack version upgrades. Off by default (SEED_RECONCILER_ENABLED); the master and seed-defaults flags are still checked per org. 24 new real-Postgres tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwsiICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6CYQAG41orTs/UqLXI4hc98LN2jI\n/DHuUwMmkmkARm3pfBNQBVdTYPPwEG8anTT5F2tbcUFNN70O7e3jqFB5Rlm9T1Xw\nnQ5zs8I3WWh9e1TFdc4IA/d96s/GW2p6VCAlCYl2DRv19C42qd4ZVEpqb7pLQiUD\n7AMMegxleV3yl1P2BS1fMEVtZ/TmRum941lMgnQ24OEniXS+aFCEZPurI1M4qTdX\nLZVsFV4r8Pwutn1rzdsrzS4LVy/Iqv0kTDe7AImdCGMo+Ku4ZITQ4WiFiw6X9XaH\n9k1NB1fskFjpNQvUosF2qKt5jEFVrerhnMejSbmj5PC+ZHzviLEOn0lPmtOkiyN+\nJhZin