er and containerd (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/helm/kind-action/issues/160\">#160</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/helm/kind-action/commit/b59aafa4920dab31e3374a313d6f7ab4215dec30\"><code>b59aafa</code></a>\nBump actions/checkout from 6.0.2 to 6.0.3 in the actions group (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/helm/kind-action/issues/161\">#161</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/helm/kind-action/commit/8e3316b7c00769c77334bd22a1cde0d325cd37a4\"><code>8e3316b</code></a>\nclean up ci (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/helm/kind-action/issues/158\">#158</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/helm/kind-action/compare/ef37e7f390d99f746eb8b610417061a60e82a6cc...06c1ae10762d3b9c1644e7fe69596ae519e015a2\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwqkACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvCoQAJFgqQfEd45KWYhWHSDBXSs1\nNe6v28qe32CpJOK8BfVxdfdYqvTSjLoGKTMMNSe8OHDNNPPahRFdqfJ4Y4uiJPZZ\nyXKCwTsC/pdmTfPHbSz1E4nJOg7PyqQyPdFPiFYiJUtwGuhnkrNcN1hcwKlPzwka\nzZEllft17vkp+rqIHP3DCWsLi1MMcZvW8+VYG04bDZZQXPKgbh3FqbhbZMnVLwrH\nk++r0v68pVUu5FvcC2GP+SvEDsAs7E05TCaJagQO+f2uul4tS968JkG9rF724yLn\nt+rmJ6PeH4K+SsBVn4uDbpUtWBg+6oqMouebKkVvC5Hur3cp7xCldkID1ymy2QSW\n37pwxi0ur2EgqBj4ArLpnZDienu6Y7OtR74XPr5+If4AGSiJZgmGWQAzGP2xzD6m\n2c+SX5YxDBcpAgde67ueW0/NdjQv1r2lAJl2cN33W2TXFqhSKZ9rEZeqOK2xHuFl\nHOKg0qnn6nRAKwIO2cy91KQcoOcoveznPt0lxUlc27sruvaMCU/wtzgfa1iO3YEy\nvTSdNGbt/H06TFX0JoQD/p6IvVvVI5uA3qqjYOP7fRuq+zJkXUw9ucYz0QTrNdDH\n7IsSPUP6K4MwaTK0UI6IAx+2CNzSjzLYpXcMIEMut8dGXEdK6xllKhCSucAT2N5j\nIrBANAzJK3Ygi2wKqE3X\n=0UM+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T19:29:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/event