fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/0e70bcee2442037673260d7e9e9997ca6c9a8bc2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:25:51Z","email":"321521006+fuze-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"fuze-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:25:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(selection-list-service): identity.org.created + seed.requested consumers, org projection tombstone (SL6) (#1271)\n\norg-created handler upserts the org projection and seeds platform defaults only when the master and seed-defaults flags are ON; seed-requested handler does schema parse, scope check, per-message flag check, fail-closed attestation introspection (scope selection-lists:seed, subject bound to the allowlisted source) and applySeedRequest, with the token redacted everywhere; org-deleted tombstones the projection. gate-microservice-events policy updated (identity.user.created not applicable: no user-scoped lists). Flags stay OFF.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1","tree":{"sha":"f9bd02a24ea14dee26d7a7ea4851266aebcfaaa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/f9bd02a24ea14dee26d7a7ea4851266aebcfaaa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/0e70bcee2442037673260d7e9e9997ca6c9a8bc2","verification":{"payload":"tree f9bd02a24ea14dee26d7a7ea4851266aebcfaaa5\nparent ab2d153a