ers/izzywdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/bb2858c4a10f8c40748a3a67f58c65297f6a963d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T18:23:19Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T18:23:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(selection-list-service): transactional outbox in every mutating route + per-org ordered relay (SL6) (#1265)\n\nenqueueEvent validates against the shared Zod schemas and writes to event_outbox in the request transaction; a per-org ordered relay (SKIP LOCKED, 10 attempts then DLQ) publishes only when KAFKA_BROKERS is set. Routes aligned to the OpenAPI key/code/locale/length limits so event payloads can never be invalid. 66 new tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1","tree":{"sha":"b0564661bf14a8226cde990e391904e9533eca23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/b0564661bf14a8226cde990e391904e9533eca23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/bb2858c4a10f8c40748a3a67f58c65297f6a963d","verification":{"payload":"tree b05