1576be83c79ed6136ad73c1d8f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/297043928ec381576be83c79ed6136ad73c1d8f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99821070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/fuze-agent","id":321521006,"login":"fuze-agent[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOEyoFbg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fuze-agent%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/ec0b4da00dda093e1531b71e48feeb37acfd1596/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:45:16Z","email":"321521006+fuze-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"fuze-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:45:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(db): per-service database and dedicated login role, selection-list-service reference (#1244)\n\nTrue per-service data ownership: selection-list-service gets its own database (fuzefront_selection_list) owned by its own LOGIN role (selection_list_svc: NOSUPERUSER/NOCREATEDB/NOCREATEROLE/NOREPLICATION) with its own credentials in Secret/selection-list-secrets (DB_PASSWORD only). The shared fuzefront_user role is explicitly denied and PUBLIC CONNECT is revoked.\n\n- templates/service-db-bootstrap-job.yaml: generic pre-install/pre-upgrade Job per entry of database.bootstrap.serviceDatabases. Idempotent psql: create/ALTER role and reconcile the password from the Secret (env, never argv; statement logging suppressed), CREATE DATABASE ... OWNER, REVOKE from PUBLIC and the shared role, fail the sync if any non-owner grantee remains. Nothing renders while the service is disabled.\n- db-bootstrap-job: selection-list removed from EXTRA_DATABASES.\n- selection-list deployment: DB_* env from the per-service values and Secret instead of DATABASE_URL; JWT_SECRET from the chart Secret like sibling services.\n- rotate-sealed-secret.yml: allow first-time creation of a manifest under deploy/contabo/sealed/ and detect untracked manifests.\n- docs/runbooks/per-service-database-and-role.md: pattern, rotation, adding the next service, threat model.\n\nThe service stays disabled everywhere; rendered output for values.yaml, values-local.yaml and values-prod.yaml is unchanged. Remaining manual step: dispatch rotate-sealed-secret.yml to mint and seal the password, then enable the service in a separate later merge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1","tree":{"sha":"4967999571af11cc92e9a76e8dcb245ef58df1b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/4967999571af11cc92e9a76e8dcb245ef58df1b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/ec0b4da00dda093e1531b71e48feeb37acfd1596","verification":{"payload":"tree 4967999571af11cc92e9a76e8dcb245ef58df1b5\nparent aec50a3049d1a01558d56a0040fd9b4460e0b81b\nauthor fuze-agent[bot] <321521006+fuze-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1791121516 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791121516 +0300\n\nfeat(db): per-service database and dedicated login role, selection-list-service reference (#1244)\n\nTrue per-service data ownership: selection-list-service gets its own database (fuzefront_selection_list) owned by its own LOGIN role (selection_list_svc: NOSUPERUSER/NOCREATEDB/NOCREATEROLE/NOREPLICATION) with its own credentials in Secret/selection-list-secrets (DB_PASSWORD only). The shared fuzefront_user role is explicitly denied and PUBLIC CONNECT is revoked.\n\n- templates/service-db-bootstrap-job.yaml: generic pre-install/pre-upgrade Job per entry of database.bootstrap.serviceDatabases. Idempotent psql: create/ALTER role and reconcile the password from the Secret (env, never argv; statement logging suppressed), CREATE DATABASE ... OWNER, REVOKE from PUBLIC and the shared role, fail the sync if any non-owner grantee remains. Nothing renders while the service is disabled.\n- db-bootstrap-job: selection-list removed from EXTRA_DATABASES.\n- selection-list deployment: DB_* env from the per-service values and Secret instead of DATABASE_URL; JWT_SECRET from the chart Secret like sibling services.\n- rotate-sealed-secret.yml: allow first-time creation of a manifest under deploy/contabo/sealed/ and detect untracked manifests.\n- docs/runbooks/per-service-database-and-role.md: pattern, rotation, adding the next service, threat model.\n\nThe service stays disabled everywhere; rendered output for values.yaml, values-local.yaml and values-prod.yaml is unchanged. Remaining manual step: dispatch rotate-sealed-secret.yml to mint and seal the password, then enable the service in a separate later merge.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwlhsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHFAQAHtKePAR1aTaRFLd+4a+TEBm\n8gXGZbjLUqVyNn8JMZ20p6tOCB8QTiIqbro4o19nkPaUQhBhOnsN86xDFFRM6N3G\nfNzUWo8NFFvQjuPXQgymghTuAnXhKG/UybDk7nrjCX301Ar9U0BRySF+3lhbMnzJ\ninVijzUzpWH/2d7PtSDGlLyPyuYO4ZHLLypA6cU/xyDLVSQZmozHx/n0FBISWnFT\nW633cfnjYDfzIeoEWCfsiKbi8HMMNqXJ1d7QpWF5q