nEvidence (500 runs, 2026-09-23 to 2026-10-04) that fuze-code-review''s review step is force-cancelled at exactly job-timeout + 5 min because the `fuzefront` runner pod is lost mid-step, repo-wide and in both scale-set generations. Includes the tested llm-endpoint docker-timeout patch for a FuzeSDLC PR (the file is managed and cannot be fixed here) and a DRAFT, NOT SENT @fuze delegation to FuzeInfra.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1","tree":{"sha":"f3f4c9c47c8fa1af02406381c0dab60f795420eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/f3f4c9c47c8fa1af02406381c0dab60f795420eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/53485da359564fb1626c02bef2577e83ddabe6b3","verification":{"payload":"tree f3f4c9c47c8fa1af02406381c0dab60f795420eb\nparent f6d703c9ba49ddec1c0acc6a623f46032797a62a\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791120367 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791120367 +0300\n\ndocs(ci): fuze-code-review runner-loss evidence and draft FuzeInfra delegation (#1242)\n\nEvidence (500 runs, 2026-09-23 to 2026-10-04) that fuze-code-review''s review step is force-cancelled at exactly job-timeout + 5 min because the `fuzefront` runner pod is lost mid-step, repo-wide and in both scale-set generations. Includes the tested llm-endpoint docker-timeout patch for a FuzeSDLC PR (the file is managed and cannot be fixed here) and a DRAFT, NOT SENT @fuze delegation to FuzeInfra.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwlPvCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVG8QACE2t/u2zzB8WPQT39jWmpw9\n0TvzCAiLPfWFuG0tlN9PRxZHJ4ExKqvGG522jUBoIa0PnaHPKgZnAyFHAmUe8KWH\nZaKhPNtiehEO1eLcx8pyQ0Tmm+jX7E0Z3sd+EOhChcouCmVL+T5Sx6xZmX+XKgrC\nr7Pu0BsgBMTGMFqL4HhWXlrCeSHDVNr