SelectionLists accepts the contract''s key filter; the picker looks a list up with one call instead of walking pages.\n- resolveItems maps the contract { results, missing } body to the UI shape, de-duplicates ids and splits only above the 500-id cap.\n- bump @fuzeone/selection-lists-ui to 0.2.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1","tree":{"sha":"70a406d3f7d25ebe05f1f26240020c2d60d824bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/70a406d3f7d25ebe05f1f26240020c2d60d824bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/f6d703c9ba49ddec1c0acc6a623f46032797a62a","verification":{"payload":"tree 70a406d3f7d25ebe05f1f26240020c2d60d824bb\nparent 2173af0e1365bef686057206c0fc5e7e34acd6e8\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791120010 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791120010 +0300\n\nfeat(selection-lists-ui): picker multi initialValue, purged-value replacement, key filter lookup, contract resolve shape (#1239)\n\n- multi mode initialValue is string[] (discriminated-union props); all seeded ids resolve in one POST /v1/resolve, never fire onChange, and keep the touchedRef late-resolve protection. Archived ids stay until removed; purged ids render as Unknown value and are swapped out by the next pick.\n- single mode: a purged stored value now renders a usable control so the user can pick a replacement.\n- listSelectionLists accepts the contract''s key filter; the picker looks a list up with one call instead of walking pages.\n- resolveItems maps the contract { results, missing } body to the UI shape, de-duplicates ids and splits only above the 500-id cap.\n- bump @fuzeone/selection-lists-ui to 0.2.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\