eFront/git/commits/b9aa77c3bd67264811d9ca234bac4cc3da361371","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commit/b9aa77c3bd67264811d9ca234bac4cc3da361371","node_id":"C_kwDOOzNzMNoAKGI5YWE3N2MzYmQ2NzI2NDgxMWQ5Y2EyMzRiYWM0Y2MzZGEzNjEzNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commit/d3834cc80f73b6d739c6da9ac23a632c2fd1d09f","sha":"d3834cc80f73b6d739c6da9ac23a632c2fd1d09f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/d3834cc80f73b6d739c6da9ac23a632c2fd1d09f"}],"sha":"b9aa77c3bd67264811d9ca234bac4cc3da361371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/b9aa77c3bd67264811d9ca234bac4cc3da361371"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99821070?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/d3834cc80f73b6d739c6da9ac23a632c2fd1d09f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:00:57Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:00:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(identity): cnv/msg/ntf are platform messaging; tenant sales money and parties are product-namespaced (#1195)\n\n## 📋 Description\n\nSettles the three questions in #1194, which came out of the family\nownership proposal (izzywdev/FuzeSDLC#454). **Comments only: no prefix\nvalue, type or runtime behaviour changes.**\n\n1. **Who owns conversations? Option (a).** `cnv`/`msg`/`ntf` stay\nFuzeFront spine types and mean **platform** messaging: in-app chat and\nnotifications between platform users. Customer-facing omnichannel\nconversations (voice, WhatsApp, Messenger, email, web chat with a\ntenant''s customers) are FuzeContact''s and use FuzeContact''s product\nnamespace.\n- *Rejected, (b): moving `cnv`/`msg` to FuzeContact.* Prefixes are\npermanent once shipped; re-homing them is a wire-breaking change for\nevery stored reference, and FuzeFront''s own messaging would then need\nnew prefixes. Option (a) changes nothing on the wire.\n2. **Party ids:** no `party` spine type yet. The Party master proposed\nin #454 doesn''t exist, so party ids stay product-namespaced until it\ndoes. The comment also records that `prt` is `portal`, not party.\n3. **Billing:** no change. The comment now states that\n`cus`/`sub`/`pay`/`inv`/`crd` are Fuze''s **own** SaaS billing, and that\na tenant''s sales money belongs to FuzeFinance and uses FuzeFinance''s\nproduct namespace.\n\nFixes #1194\n\n## 🔄 Type of Change\n\n- [x] 📝 Documentation update\n\n## 🧪 Testing\n\n- [x] Manual testing: rebuilt `dist/` with `tsc -p tsconfig.json`. The\nonly file that changed is `dist/registry.js`, and **every changed line\nis a `//` comment**. Checked by filtering the diff for non-comment\nlines: none.\n- Unit tests not run. No executable line changed, and this session can''t\ninstall the monorepo''s dependencies.\n\n## 🔧 Implementation Details\n\n### Changes Made\n\n- **SDK Changes:** `packages/identity/src/registry.ts` comments on the\nbilling and messaging groups, and the matching rebuilt\n`dist/registry.js`.\n- The comment mirrored in `scripts/gate_identifier.py` (\"messaging —\nlikewise hosted here for the family\") is a governance-managed file\nsynced from FuzeSDLC, so it isn''t edited here. Changing it belongs in\nthe canonical copy.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- [x] Documentation has been updated (the registry is the source of\ntruth, and its comments are the documentation)\n\n## 🚨 Breaking Changes\n\nNone.\n\n## 🔗 Related Issues and PRs\n\n- Closes #1194\n- Related to izzywdev/FuzeSDLC#454 and izzywdev/FuzeContact#80\n(FuzeContact''s contract side)\n\n## 📝 Additional Notes\n\n### Questions for Reviewers\n\n- Merging this PR is how option (a) gets accepted. If you prefer (b),\nclose it and I''ll open the migration plan instead.\n\n## 🔄 Backwards Compatibility\n\n- [x] Fully backwards compatible\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01YRQJYPTcmjDT2NzH8zsr81\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6119537097189c5722f602b056a63ad70dc1a506","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/6119537097189c5722f602b056a63ad70dc1a506"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/d3834cc80f73b6d739c6da9ac23a632c2fd1d09f","verification":{"payload":"tree 6119537097189c5722f602b056a63ad70dc1a506\nparent cb4560a31add1bdcbb71e380bb000f36c594c5da\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791104457 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791104457 +0000\n\ndocs(identity): cnv/msg/ntf are platform messaging; tenant sales money and parties are product-namespaced (#1195)\n\n## 📋 Description\n\nSettles the three questions in #1194, which came out of the family\nownership proposal (izzywdev/FuzeSDLC#454). **Comments only: no prefix\nvalue, type or runt