OFF):\n\n- **Per-portal console** (`/portal/admin`) —\n`fuzefront.identity.portal-scoped-users` (Users tab) +\n`fuzefront.apps.portal-catalog` (Catalog tab)\n- **Portal billing** (`/portal/admin/billing`) —\n`fuzefront.billing.reseller-connect` (reseller Stripe-connect)\n\n## 🔧 Changes\n- **`packages/feature-flags/src/catalog.ts`** — add the three keys to\n`FLAG_KEYS` + `WEB_EXPOSED_FLAGS` (release, default OFF) so `GET\n/api/flags` discloses them and the browser can read them.\n- **`.github/workflows/prod-unleash-ops.yml`** — add a `portal-console`\nflag set (apply + dispatch + verify) that GA''s all three to 100%,\nmirroring the existing `portals-directory` set.\n\nNo components built — the UI (`packages/portal-admin-ui`), flows, host\npages, and backend mutation endpoints already exist and ship tests.\n\n## ✅ Verification\n- Workflow YAML parses; three new `check_flag` lines in the\n`portal-console` Verify case.\n- No flag-count/membership test pins `WEB_EXPOSED_FLAGS`, so the\nadditions don''t break existing tests.\n- **Post-merge:** dispatch `prod-unleash-ops.yml` (`flags:\nportal-console`), read back the Verify step, confirm all three print\n`ON`.\n\nGA per owner decision 2026-10-04 (izzy). Billing entitlement remains\nenforced by Permit; the flag is rollout convenience only.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_0127R9Zcw92tmBkxUUuLEB79\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_0127R9Zcw92tmBkxUUuLEB79)_\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2dbcd676f061c980f5d76057bc37ef6b2414fb83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/2dbcd676f061c980f5d76057bc37ef6b2414fb83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/cd9397ba71939c862cbdd78e9af1b279ca5d4a9f","verification":{"payload":"tree 2dbcd676f061c980f5d76057bc37ef6b2414fb83\nparent 72badaf91916edcbd93f430e629fa5aa1083f778\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791102538 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791102538 +0300\n\nfeat(flags): enable portal admin console + reseller billing surfaces (#1222)\n\n## 📋 Description\nActivates the two remaining **portal admin console** surfaces, which are\nalready built/routed/tested but were dark because their gate flags were\nnever disclosed to the browser nor wired for CI enablement (so\n`useFlag()` always fell back to OFF):\n\n- **Per-portal console** (`/portal/admin`) —\n`fuzefront.identity.portal-scoped-users` (Users tab) +\n`fuzefront.apps.portal-catalog` (Catalog tab)\n- **Portal billing** (`/portal/admin/billing`) —\n`fuzefront.billing.reseller-connect` (reseller Stripe-connect)\n\n## 🔧 Changes\n- **`packages/feature-flags/src/catalog.ts`** — add the three keys to\n`FLAG_KEYS` + `WEB_EXPOSED_FLAGS` (release, default OFF) so `GET\n/api/flags` discloses them and the browser can read them.\n- **`.github/workflows/prod-unleash-ops.yml`** — add a `portal-console`\nflag set (apply + dispatch + verify) that GA''s all three to 100%,\nmirroring the existing `portals-directory` set.\n\nNo components built — the UI (`packages/portal-admin-ui`), flows, host\npages, and backend mutation endpoints already exist and ship tests.\n\n## ✅ Verification\n- Workflow YAML parses; three new `check_flag` lines in the\n`portal-console` Verify case.\n- No flag-count/membership test pins `WEB_EXPOSED_FLAGS`, so the\nadditions don''t break existing tests.\n- **Post-merge:** dispatch `prod-unleash-ops.yml` (`flags:\nportal-console`), read back the Verify step, confirm all three print\n`ON`.\n\nGA per owner decision 2026-10-04 (izzy). Billing entitlement remains\nenforced by Permit; the flag is rollout convenience only.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_0127R9Zcw92tmBkxUUuLEB79\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_0127R9Zcw92tmBkxUUuLEB79)_\n\nCo-authored-by: Cl