electionListManagementFlow`, `TranslationWorkbenchFlow`,\n`SelectionListAccessFlow`, `SelectionListPickerHarness` and `api.ts`.\nThe `./api` module is mocked at the boundary; `fetch` is stubbed for the\napi tests.\n- Covers happy path, loading, empty, error/retry and the fail-closed\ncases from `design/frames/selection-lists/` (quota fail-open, 404\nnot-found, last-owner 409, 403 read-only, typed purge confirm, reorder\nrollback, archived/purged picker values, max selections), RTL target\ncells (ar/he) and a11y roles.\n- Coverage config + thresholds in `vite.config.ts` (95/95/90/85).\nMeasured: 99.6% stmts / 94.2% branches / 98.2% funcs.\n- `setup.ts`: fixed jest-dom type reference that pointed outside the\nrepo.\n\n## Tiny bug fixes found by the tests\n1. Reorder failure with a non-`VALIDATION_ERROR` code rendered no\nmessage.\n2. Autofill failure lost the service message (spreading an `Error` drops\n`message`).\n3. Picker never pre-selected an ACTIVE `initialValue` (only\narchived/missing).\n\n## Known gaps pinned with `it.fails` (not fixed)\n- Autofill result / \"nothing to do\" never visible (modal unmounts on\ncompletion) — frame 09.\n- Reorder `VALIDATION_ERROR` does not reload the list — frame 05.\n- Form labels are not associated with controls (NewList, AddAccess) —\na11y.\n\n## Not done\n- `@vitest/coverage-v8` devDependency not added (lockfile regen needed);\n`npm test` is unaffected, coverage runs need it.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1)_\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfe730046ebc07fbaa7ba12405330b984aed305d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/cfe730046ebc07fbaa7ba12405330b984aed305d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/72badaf91916edcbd93f430e629fa5aa1083f778","verification":{"payload":"tree cfe730046ebc07fbaa7ba12405330b984aed305d\nparent 76002f56e49cc6a0c0f1f4631d12fcb6b76a8ee1\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791101140 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791101140 +0300\n\ntest(selection-lists-ui): unit tests for the four flows + api client, coverage floor (#1215)\n\n## Summary\n- Adds 222 vitest + @testing-library/react tests under\n`packages/selection-lists-ui/src/test/` for\n`SelectionListManagementFlow`, `TranslationWorkbenchFlow`,\n`SelectionListAccessFlow`, `SelectionListPickerHarness` and `api.ts`.\nThe `./api` module is mocked at the boundary; `fetch` is stubbed for the\napi tests.\n- Covers happy path, loading, empty, error/retry and the fail-closed\ncases from `design/frames/selection-lists/` (quota fail-open, 404\nnot-found, last-owner 409, 403 read-only, typed purge confirm, reorder\nrollback, archived/purged picker values, max selections), RTL target\ncells (ar/he) and a11y roles.\n- Coverage config + thresholds in `vite.config.ts` (95/95/90/85).\nMeasured: 99.6% stmts / 94.2% branches / 98.2% funcs.\n- `setup.ts`: fixed jest-dom type reference that pointed outside the\nrepo.\n\n## Tiny bug fixes found by the tests\n1. Reorder failure with a non-`VALIDATION_ERROR` code rendered no\nmessage.\n2. Autofill failure lost the service message (spreading an `Error` drops\n`message`).\n3. Picker never pre-selected an ACTIVE `initialValue` (only\narchived/missing).\n\n## Known gaps pinned with `it.fails` (not fixed)\n- Autofill result / \"nothing to do\" never visible (modal unmounts on\ncompletion) — frame 09.\n- Reorder `VALIDATION_ERROR` does not reload the list — frame 05.\n- Form labels are not associated with controls (NewList, AddAccess) —\na11y.\n\n## Not done\n- `@vitest/coverage-v8` devDependency not added (lockfile regen needed);\n`npm test` is unaffected, coverage runs need it.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1)_\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwgjUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApdUQAJ0bdGEu53zTdogMRmL+5PO7\nA4YmebeFtHimfTtrMT9cZrVq+d2xTlVA9HRkDsYGXh9cGa73BHfGhekb2gfLo76J\nDH06MUALXpeda+X+1561cxq8aFHpxta/L29VLfydXxohiH0GFA+Q7hxlDDiyKdCO\nAN+sH7dmN0WOcwLrwKoyg30WkNjGjopTcNq9Ez4oO+dsWL/VefcQm0AFNqzgA5bn\n1mzILh86PEIAEebdiQ1B1efVQcA3ymA39rczoRWIcZhpJ7wUxezcLZjKrfc8hPyF\nj8oqpFsn4cXblhf6I8Rve5rQr19a5BWsebtIGNWaqW6Wi/nj/6EOmCrdv2bWvwQV\nKVaSiEWtbC02XYx8DshiSt2QKqoBK4vpwh+GKF2kucmEllV7BjxqPQw/6HP/MBC2\nD0KHk3Y7Gs380bUvJnqHncT9fxYE0twU4SctUT+7p8NrM+M9n6sPtiqFnvIiwOs8\nqttcZaysGnPnGYYlrY8ssnt3qw5TJn28v1yM02Te9KPNjXos2c1uODBI/juVQ9Vs\nEz8akzCGWFMgeD1w9R8fGKHR/PwSS+AyDrOeWsItuZdtTHaeY4fAkiyE2vZvb7aa\nOBbmaT22QnGr5mZqQBTxPFezXsiyIG4icEU0e+ts0nXG++eGHVgMrbHr8Yjcf+se\n41N5ZCiHFAq0d8L5fI3c\n=i8Ep\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T08:05:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gi