 the frontend type-checks on master (#1219)\n\n## Summary\n- `frontend` fails `tsc --noEmit` on master with 6 errors left by #1206:\n`InstallAppDialog.tsx` uses `AppInstallationsResponse` without importing\nit, and `ApplicationsPage.tsx` lost the `installed` / `installation`\nlookups its row render still uses (the `installedAppIds` /\n`installationByApp` state is now declared but never read).\n- Restores the import and the two `const` lines. No behaviour change\nbeyond making the already-written code compile.\n- These errors were hidden behind the `@fuzefront/feature-flags` install\nfailure fixed in #1214; once install worked, `Lint & Test (24.x)` failed\nat \"Type checking\" on every PR.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] `Lint & Test (24.x)` type-check step passes\n- Locally, none of the 6 original errors remain in `tsc --noEmit`\noutput. The remaining local errors (`@fuzefront/i18n`, design-system\n`BadgeProps`) come from workspace packages not being built in this\ncheckout, not from this change.\n- Not rendered in a browser (UI runtime validation not done); change is\ntype-only restoration.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1)_\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f07fbf37d029da1da9f2a8092797e604f9830c1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/f07fbf37d029da1da9f2a8092797e604f9830c1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/76002f56e49cc6a0c0f1f4631d12fcb6b76a8ee1","verification":{"payload":"tree f07fbf37d029da1da9f2a8092797e604f9830c1f\nparent fd8832271304d7f6192c0bb684cef1288f9f0931\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791101092 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791101092 +0300\n\nfix(frontend): restore dropped lines so the frontend type-checks on master (#1219)\n\n## Summary\n- `frontend` fails `tsc --noEmit` on master with 6 errors left by #1206:\n`InstallAppDialog.tsx` uses `AppInstallationsResponse` without importing\nit, and `ApplicationsPage.tsx` lost the `installed` / `installation`\nlookups its row render still uses (the `installedAppIds` /\n`installationByApp` state is now declared but never read).\n- Restores the import and the two `const` lines. No behaviour change\nbeyond making the already-written code compile.\n- These errors were hidden behind the `@fuzefront/feature-flags` install\nfailure fixed in #1214; once install worked, `Lint & Test (24.x)` failed\nat \"Type checking\" on every PR.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] `Lint & Test (24.x)` type-check step passes\n- Locally, none of the 6 original errors remain in `tsc --noEmit`\noutput. The remaining local errors (`@fuzefront/i18n`, design-system\n`BadgeProps`) come from workspace packages not being built in this\ncheckout, not from this change.\n- Not rendered in a browser (UI runtime validation not done); change is\ntype-only restoration.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude\nCode](https://claude.ai/code/session_018PKRvNfpskTKPUfDc8X1G1)_\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwgikCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEgAQAHmoTtZgFucJDoBBV5y+ssek\nFaUNb2gl0i3RrSNo73O1q69M+JzpymAHu63yucMarZ/H8rSrMtJXw3w73YlrGr5p\nSpoJLjPXJyX2VHykOiBbWE+0v2VJYYxQP19PoLklPB4Pu1iDRpfiKZ9Enbhg9CdJ\n/9SuhbTOvWTjYrhSWulwg4/WrpvejXXY6grdNXScYJVGdztE5dqC4BqJc4hCM3fv\nzewSKvVkKZC7VLbxyhLyX7Lsd7Xsav02O6zrHMFgJaFFgvsP9lFYsQSseKA7wL0z\nTjN4Sp+Y7PBKmmiI7ylDkyABy5Zk9F4YItmpQwNXP4OnQp7DGTFTJ1cFwYhr6ejm\nA14epIEuSUpvjYJYKXF/O/PkA9ifJhYC1sel8vJPzhBnuyke1ix+PdrglmYBH9rc\n+5Q/a4aZFHQEdwPQ9TgjienxU7oG3dz/cK7jyW374rDn2D2Kx0zL6kdsJkhNyt5U\nc8L/w2dcrXfDdBB9SOi5egCi5sP56WXYX7v+FNoZsZb0pFuh+sq5+BOBGi8gtOsl\nSTZvclcTqFsvA2mXW1PK1