_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/izzywdev","id":99821070,"login":"izzywdev","node_id":"U_kgDOBfMmDg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/izzywdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/commits/fd8832271304d7f6192c0bb684cef1288f9f0931/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T08:01:07Z","email":"99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Israel Weinberg"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T08:01:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix source resolution for feature-flags workspace package (#1214)\n\n## Problem\n`packages/feature-flags` is version 1.0.1, while four consumers and the\nroot lockfile request `@fuzefront/feature-flags@1.0.0`. A clean `npm ci`\ntherefore tries to download that unavailable version from the registry\nand fails with E404, blocking production state-key deployment.\n\n## Change\nPoint backend, applications, security and chat service at the\nin-repository workspace package with relative `file:` references.\nSynchronize the lockfile''s workspace version to 1.0.1. No runtime or\ngate changes.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm ci --ignore-scripts --offline --no-audit --no-fund` succeeds from\na clean worktree at current master.\n- `node scripts/check-workspace-deps.mjs` passes.\n- `npm ls @fuzefront/feature-flags --all --parseable` resolves to the\nlocal workspace package.","tree":{"sha":"61c46f811d2355a27075d0c5f0e64063eb828f8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/61c46f811d2355a27075d0c5f0e64063eb828f8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/fd8832271304d7f6192c0bb684cef1288f9f0931","verification":{"payload":"tree 61c46f811d2355a27075d0c5f0e64063eb828f8e\nparent a0de54f25b69a04c468ecd28fb760ad52497e775\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1791100867 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791100867 +0300\n\nFix source resolution for feature-flags workspace package (#1214)\n\n## Problem\n`packages/feature-flags` is version 1.0.1, while four consumers and the\nroot lockfile request `@fuzefront/feature-flags@1.0.0`. A clean `npm ci`\ntherefore tries to download that unavailable version from the registry\nand fails with E404, blocking production state-key deployment.\n\n## Change\nPoint backend, applications, security and chat service at the\nin-repository workspace package with relative `file:` references.\nSynchronize the lockfile''s workspace version to 1.0.1. No runtime or\ngate changes.\n\n## Verification\n- `npm ci --ignore-scripts --offline --no-audit --no-fund` succeeds from\na clean worktree at current master.\n- `node scripts/check-workspace-deps.mjs` passes.\n- `npm ls @fuzefront/feature-flags --all --parseable` resolves to the\nlocal workspace package.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwgfDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4mUQAJv0zL6S1g9g/VL2UMZUartE\nLWO9ccYy0Kk/MrUYZM10SF6UtSj4dcDPOwTiYVjcHf+9qoJZjNkEQ2SxvJmJMphQ\nFHOQrEHXdm8rq2piXOxOhZGdIWxyxRK26D7az7q+KFMgnEoFTYseHozylwOWNZUC\nrsF5CaFO9Di7c59iZJxdtABvKMSY4poT7sfZbKS7tYw2Dco353+m8vJ6yrgl+KQz\nG1GKKY/wnK3WmRwn1BECoIIbb5qhnBCgRkTm308ORQiYMa0PB95F5x9D5jGFd7RY\nwEUakbBosxYb6zmbRO1LO3Ei5TGP2qCvAAVNrk11e4tDr6Du4npIhCK+UMtcV8Gh\nLF80pgn+BwWwYeekc8eZQtfZl+Bj9fdrVvGuI2yFHTOEPD5D9kascuL95+EGxxkd\nGPPefkts/wjPjjboeyrRkuPhrHv4q9xF5sPsaY9AD159V0tj735bEiZ4UNvqfSmR\nxvzqeBj+h3bTzXDlFIBpb0AkD0G1NuH4xC0mKMUKW3kD5