ntrue\\ and \\installMode: ''everyone''\\.\n- Adds migration \\\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot[bot] <fuzeone-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"14ff75332c1e2e3c64981fec478e48cf03efc1dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/trees/14ff75332c1e2e3c64981fec478e48cf03efc1dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/izzywdev/FuzeFront/git/commits/a0de54f25b69a04c468ecd28fb760ad52497e775","verification":{"payload":"tree 14ff75332c1e2e3c64981fec478e48cf03efc1dd\nparent 3914d0648a2f095d19fed81dfb2f0c4f13e771ab\nauthor Israel Weinberg <99821070+izzywdev@users.noreply.github.com> 1790855565 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790855565 +0300\n\nfeat(apps): add org-level only installation option and configure FuzeSocial (#1206)\n\n## Summary\n- Introduces \\installMode\\ (\\''self'' | ''everyone'' | ''both''\\) and\n\\orgLevelOnly\\ (\\\boolean\\) in the App Manifest and App Registry schema,\ncontracts, and APIs.\n- Rejects installation attempts in personal scope or with \\self\\ mode\nfor org-level only apps (returns 422 \\ORG_LEVEL_ONLY\\).\n- Defaults install mode to \\''everyone''\\ for org-level only apps and\nverifies org admin permissions.\n- Updates UI:\n- In \\InstallAppDialog\\, locks mode selection to ''Whole organization''\nwith a clear explanatory notice, disabling user-level installation for\norg-level only apps.\n- In \\ApplicationsPage\\, passes \\installMode\\ and \\orgLevelOnly\\ and\nprevents personal installs.\n- Configures \\ uzesocial\\ built-in and seed manifest with \\orgLevelOnly:\ntrue\\ and \\installMode: ''everyone''\\.\n- Adds migration \\\n\nCo-authored-by: fuzeone-bot[bot] <fuzeone-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvkmNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAu3gQAJcjojWykZtqHCjCV7uqxMUh\n0JkydX/olgDRZxx5p+FOIQcpq+yBqsgjTcn7BUZMN+lxzL/mU4SlAzJorNMer7b4\n0IMjrWzSFqblqN+eeb3/avbY4k9qPERks8uCylgpgonG3H1atX5zqz1Ysaro6S+M\n3Js9TFEapvBVj/YmwH5+b98OukLhoAj